    challengesLabel: THE CHALLENGES
    challenge: '<p data-end="111" data-start="55"><strong data-end="74" data-start="55">Product import:</strong> Import more than 50,000 spare parts.</p><p data-end="213" data-start="113"><strong data-end="129" data-start="113">Flexibility:</strong> Remain as standard as possible while meeting highly specific business requirements.</p><p data-end="415" data-start="215"><strong data-end="257" data-start="215">Incorrect product type classification:</strong> In the previous Odoo database, goods and services were mixed and sometimes grouped under a single product, causing operational and reporting inconsistencies.</p><p data-end="586" data-start="417"><strong data-end="457" data-start="417">Maintenance subscription management:</strong> Implementing a reliable system to sell, schedule, and automatically invoice recurring maintenance contracts was a key challenge.</p><p data-end="762" data-start="588"><strong data-end="639" data-start="588">Electronic invoicing compliance and automation:</strong>
      Integration with Peppol was essential to comply with electronic invoicing regulations and streamline accounting processes.</p><p data-end="986" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="" data-start="764"><strong data-end="797" data-start="764">Complete customer experience:</strong> Fernatech wanted to provide its customers with a full digital experience, including a website and a customer portal where they could access their invoices, service requests, and documents.</p><img alt="fernatech" class="aligncenter wp-image-1408 size-full" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="329" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" src="/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/fernatech.jpg" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/fernatech.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/05/fernatech-300x96.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/05/fernatech-768x247.jpg 768w" width="1024"/>'
    solutionLabel: THE SOLUTION
    solution: '<p data-end="221" data-start="55"><strong data-end="84" data-start="55">Full Odoo implementation:</strong> Agitech deployed a centralized ERP solution covering sales, invoicing, subscriptions, field service operations, and customer management.</p><strong data-end="84" data-start="55">Full Odoo implementation:</strong><p data-end="317" data-start="223"><strong data-end="261" data-start="223">Automated subscription management:</strong> Creation of maintenance subscription services enabling:</p><strong data-end="261" data-start="223">Automated subscription management:</strong><ul>

      <li data-end="353" data-start="321">automatic contract generation,</li>

